# Files executed inside Linux containers must keep LF endings, even when the
# repo is checked out on Windows with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF shebang
# ("#!/bin/sh\r") makes execve fail with ENOENT: the container entrypoint dies
# with "not found" (exit 127) and restart-loops.
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.envsh    text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf     text eol=lf
